error[E0277]: `ReadOnlyTransaction<'_>` may only read, so it cannot run this write
 --> tests/read-only-fail/delete_in_read_only_transaction.rs:7:41
  |
7 |         Delete::many(cake::Entity).exec(tx).await?;
  |                                    ---- ^^ this writes, which needs a `ConnectionMut`
  |                                    |
